; An invented journal for DotAmi's tests: a small design studio in Canada.
; Every name, client and amount here is made up.
# hash comments are comments too
* and so are star lines (org-mode headings)

decimal-mark .

account assets:bank:chequing        ; type: C
account assets:receivable
account income                      ; type: R
account income:design
account income:interest
account liabilities:gst-hst
account expenses:software
account equity:opening

commodity CAD 1,000.00
commodity USD 1,000.00

P 2026-02-01 USD CAD 1.35
payee Northwind Client

comment
Everything in a comment block is skipped, even lines that look like directives:
include other.journal
~ monthly
end comment

2026-01-03 Opening balances
    assets:bank:chequing        CAD 5,000.00
    equity:opening

2026-01-15 * (INV-001) Northwind Client | logo design
    ; an indented comment on the transaction
    assets:receivable           CAD 1,130.00
    income:design              CAD -1,000.00
    liabilities:gst-hst         CAD -130.00   ; GST/HST collected

2026/01/28 ! Northwind Client pays INV-001
    assets:bank:chequing        1,130.00 CAD = CAD 6,130.00
    assets:receivable

2026.2.5 Harbour Corp (US client) website
    assets:bank:chequing        CAD 2,700.00
    income:design               USD -2,000.00 @ CAD 1.35

2026-02-27 Paid at the end of February, earned in March
    income:design               CAD -500.00   ; date: 2026-03-02
    assets:bank:chequing         CAD 500.00

2026-03-10=2026-03-12 Software subscription
    expenses:software              CAD 25.00
    assets:bank:chequing

2026-03-15 A fraction of a cent, which DotAmi never rounds
    income:design                 CAD -0.005
    assets:bank:chequing           CAD 0.005

2026-03-20 Part refund to Northwind Client
    income:design                 CAD 200.00
    assets:bank:chequing         CAD -200.00

2026-03-31 Bank interest
    assets:bank:chequing             CAD 1.23
    income:interest

2026-04-02 Exchange US dollars
    assets:bank:chequing        CAD 135.00
    assets:bank:chequing        USD -100.00 @@ CAD 135.00

2026-10-02 A sale in a month that hasn't ended
    assets:receivable           CAD 400.00
    income:design              CAD -400.00
